There was a particular hullabaloo as a man in a white suit and polka-
1477	1538	"Who in the name of God is that?" asked an incredulous Lynch.
1539	1604	"That," I said, "is the one and only Pádraig Flynn from Mayo" ...
1605	1781	Though he would never have believed it that day, Jack was looking at one of those who would soon change the profile, and in some instances, the nature of Fianna Fáil for ever.

