4962	5126	This hurt Gilmartin a great deal, while also bringing the illness of his wife into the picture as the real driving force behind Gilmartin's testimony against Flynn.
5127	5226	Gilmartin responded by releasing details of meetings he held with Flynn to the McCracken Tribunal.

5226	5302	The interview is widely described as the end of Flynn's political career.



5302	5500	Retirement from politics
Flynn's second term as European Commissioner ended early in September 1999, when the entire commission resigned due to allegations of malpractice by the European Parliament.
5501	5579	He was not reappointed to the commission and retired from politics completely.
