6011	6172	He receives annual pension payments of €87,129 from his time as a TD and Minister, but this does not include payments for his time as a European Commissioner.



6172	6339	Mahon Tribunal report
Flynn was cited in the Mahon Tribunal for having received money from Frank Dunlop intended for Fianna Fáil, but diverted to Flynn's personal use.
6340	6411	On 22 March 2012, the final report of the Mahon Tribunal was published.
6412	6531	It found that Flynn "wrongly and corruptly" sought a substantial donation from Tom Gilmartin for the Fianna Fáil party.
